{
  spec: "[TSON-SCHEMA] §5.4, [TSON-SCHEMA] §7.2 (choice subtypes, proposed for Revision 40)"
  description: """
    A concrete variant admits its subtypes, as a field typed by it does: at `( text | base )`, `!sub` IS-A `base`
    alone, so it selects `base` and validates as a `sub`, whose `extra` is no field of `base`.
    """
  valid: _
